# Single source of truth: `AGENTS.md`

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root first. It governs all AI agents
(Cursor included) and holds the authoritative overview, doc-routing table, key flows,
build/test commands, and guardrails.

**If any other rule file conflicts with `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.md` wins.** In particular:

- Local dev is `npm run dev` (serves at <http://localhost:8787>) — not `aem up`.
- Install with `npm ci` / `npm install` — the `npm run install-all` script is deprecated.
- Governance lives in [`INVARIANTS.md`](../../INVARIANTS.md), [`.agent-policy.yml`](../../.agent-policy.yml),
  and [`SECURITY.md`](../../SECURITY.md). Never edit `cloudflare/src/auth.js` or `cloudflare/src/user.js`.

The other files in `.cursor/rules/` (`aem.mdc`, `develop.mdc`, `feature-documentation.mdc`)
remain useful references, but defer to `AGENTS.md` on any discrepancy.
